# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Function: _show_all_backups
#
# Shows all backups (both DBMS and database).
#
# Args:
#   $1 - limit: Number of results per page
#   $2 - page: Page number
#   $3 - from: Start date filter (YYYY-MM-DD)
